automating the lead capture process, you can save time and improve the efficiency of your sales and marketing efforts.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.68; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.68; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">TABLE OF CONTENTS</span></p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.68; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><a href=\"https://gohighlevelassist.freshdesk.com/a/solutions/articles/new?portalId=48000045315&amp;translate=false#How-to-connect-Google-ads%3A\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(44, 92, 197); font-weight: 400;\">How to connect Google ads:</span></a></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.68; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><a href=\"https://gohighlevelassist.freshdesk.com/a/solutions/articles/new?portalId=48000045315&amp;translate=false#Form-Field-Mapping%3A\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(44, 92, 197); font-weight: 400;\">Form Field Mapping:</span></a></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.68; margin-bottom: 3pt;\"><a href=\"https://gohighlevelassist.freshdesk.com/a/solutions/articles/new?portalId=48000045315&amp;translate=false#How-to-test-if-the-connection-is-successful%3A\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(44, 92, 197); font-weight: 400;\">How to test if the connection is successful:</span></a></p></li></ul><h2 dir=